1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
九宫格火锅，很多人吃错了
You've been eating this hotpot wrong

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
九个格子，不是分辣度
Nine grids — not spice levels

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
一锅红汤，九种火候
One red broth, nine heats

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,200
中间最旺：毛肚七秒起锅
Center's hottest — tripe, 7 seconds

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,500
十字格温和：丸子虾滑
Cross grids: meatballs, shrimp paste

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,800
四角慢炖：脑花肥肠
Corners simmer: brain, offal

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,100
它从码头来，船工发明的
Born at the docks, by boatmen

8
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,400
一人一格，各涮各的
One grid each — no fighting for food

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,700
麻辣鲜香，莽起整！
Numbing, spicy — dig in!

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,000
记住：格子分火候，不分辣
Grids split heat, not spice

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,300
火锅到底分几派？
So how many schools of hotpot?

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,600
下集：潮汕，一头牛的火锅
Next: Chaoshan — a whole-cow hotpot
